{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/TITLE_2.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conduct analysis of the plants and other natural elements of the region and flesh out your Knowledge Book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This newly-acquired knowledge will provide you with an essential guide to obtaining resources, ensuring the safety of your citizens and optimizing your city, thus promoting survival and prosperity through a sustainable approach in harmony with the surrounding natural environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/GIF_STEAM_2.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/TITLE_3.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign citizens to the research center and the hall of wisdom to launch research projects. Technological research allows you to uncover new advanced techniques, while cultural research will innovate on processes and civil structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This quest for knowledge also gives you access to several new buildings. From extraction structures to social spaces, from harvesting points to cultural buildings, every new construction and discovery helps you shape your city's evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/GIF_STEAM_3.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/TITRE_EN.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build nine districts with unique features around the various squares by cleverly placing your buildings. Take advantage of the powerful bonuses specific to each district to foster the development of your city. Meet the needs of your citizens and thrive by providing them with the most satisfying accommodations possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/Districts.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/TITLE_4.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your citizens and send them on expeditions to learn more about the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration is an important vector of progression in the game. Explore increasingly remote regions to reveal new destinations, meet other survivors and convince them to join your city, find tablets bearing priceless knowledge, and bring back new plant species to introduce into your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/GIF_STEAM_4.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/TITLE_1.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your citizens are immersed in a strange environment, both mesmerizing and unforgiving. Your goal is to build a city to help them prosper. You will need to explore, analyze and experiment with new things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Synergy, the well-being of your citizens is paramount. You will need a deep understanding of their environment to help them adapt and thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/extras/GIF_STEAM_1.gif?t=1745317904\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Revelations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/69fa3c97f173f1f24ae2630ef6eb218b414f92a8.jpg"},{"name":"Elsewhere Blossoms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/8dca8b64f7ea2576f2f93e81528b0c1c90c98265.jpg"},{"name":"Small Celebrity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/b44b9aa829654a80a1fefec3474d059aeeaa8458.jpg"},{"name":"Marking Generations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/1894760f033d0a8d1e1e602920b5dbd07ba2dd38.jpg"},{"name":"Close to Utopia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/471ebf988e1fa6c63d67665aa7c6af9f1d9d4c74.jpg"},{"name":"Better Safe Than Sorry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/b266de8cfda0a9fd42e34afcada4a267118b9288.jpg"},{"name":"Great Health","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/25a422d09589211b77b31972a60a641ab79fb4f8.jpg"},{"name":"Idle Doctors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/86ae214333419100f33808ac60906c924b28e9e6.jpg"},{"name":"Renewed Bonds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/c4b027a3c6b52038d3f2e4df6fda3b720024c14b.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Anchor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1989070/40d7edecaa75644d1bef2b3588bba0eb1e2be50b.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1989070?t=1745317904","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745317904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989070/a1d19ef